2026-10-31T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2400) 'What if one byte of one chunk is flipped on the way back? The worker verifies every chunk against its id, so the flip is caught there.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2400  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2400) 'Run the two-client gate and check that it counts exactly one owner of the garment every tick.
 # tags: rfd:exit
